  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Programme Funded Role to ACGF through the UK Mission to ASEAN and the Asian Development Bank (ADB)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Through the UK Mission to ASEAN and ADB, the programme funds a secondee who supports the delivery of the UK-ACGF. The secondee helps identify and shape green infrastructure projects, strengthen engagement with ASEAN governments, and align activities with UK priorities. They also support coordination, pipeline development, and visibility, helping ensure that UK funding is used effectively to develop projects and build partnerships</narrative>
  </description>
